cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Windrow or its derived datasets, please cite it as below."
title: "Windrow: an agent-level simulation of the Eyre Peninsula grain supply chain"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/furling-com-au/windrow"
url: "https://windrow.justinjywong.workers.dev"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
version: "1.1.0"
authors:
  - name: "Windrow project"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based deterministic simulation of the Eyre Peninsula (South Australia)
  grain supply chain - weather-gated harvest, truck logistics, receival sites, and
  ship loading at Port Lincoln - built on open and freely published data and
  calibrated against published weekly receivals and official port statistics.
  Simulation outputs are not operational data; see data/SOURCES.md and
  data/ASSUMPTIONS.md for provenance and assumptions.
